 924→+// LoopSpan wraps a Span that groups loop iterations. Each call to Iteration
 925→+// creates a child span representing one pass through the loop.
 926→+//
 927→+// Usage:
 928→+//
 929→+//	ctx, loop := perf.StartLoop(ctx, "process_sessions")
